### Time Log - Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER_ID_HERE",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "userType": "youth"
}

### Time Log - Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER_ID_HERE"
}

### Get User Time Logs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/user/USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get User Time Logs with Filters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/user/USER_ID_HERE?limit=20&skip=0&startDate=2026-06-01&endDate=2026-06-30
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get User Analytics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/user/USER_ID_HERE/analytics?days=30
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get All Time Logs (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/all
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Get All Time Logs with User Type Filter (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/all?userType=youth&limit=50&skip=0
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Platform Analytics (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/platform/analytics?days=30
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Active Sessions (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/active-sessions
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Delete Time Log (Admin Only)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/timelog/TIME_LOG_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
